  "title": "Mage In The Machine",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "\"If you're hearing this then one of three things has happened, none of them good.\" Mage In The Machine is an audio drama focused around Oz Grimhallow, a man cursed to act as an interreceptor of fates most horrible. Every episode presents a new case, a new horror that was meant for someone else to face but now directs it's attention towards our humble computer repair tech. Just remember, the more you learn the more they start to notice you. For business inquiries email mageinthemachineoffical@gmail.com",
